---
// Esencia component representing the academic details of the cacao project
---

<section id="esencia" class="esencia-section">
  <!-- Section 1: Campos Formativos -->
  <div class="campos-container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 class="section-title">Campos Formativos</h2>
      <div class="title-divider"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="cards-grid">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="formativo-card">
        <div class="paper-texture"></div>
        <div class="card-icon-wrapper">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">balance</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-heading">Ética, Naturaleza y Sociedad</h3>
        <p class="card-description">
          Exploramos el impacto socio-ambiental y la responsabilidad ética en su cadena de valor.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="formativo-card">
        <div class="paper-texture"></div>
        <div class="card-icon-wrapper">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">biotech</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-heading">Saberes y Pensamiento Científico</h3>
        <p class="card-description">
          Análisis químico y botánico del fruto, uniendo ciencia moderna con herencia ancestral.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="formativo-card">
        <div class="paper-texture"></div>
        <div class="card-icon-wrapper">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">auto_stories</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-heading">Lenguajes</h3>
        <p class="card-description">
          La narrativa visual y escrita que rodea al cacao como símbolo de identidad cultural.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Base section - Full Screen height with vertical centering */
  .esencia-section {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 100vh;
    min-height: 100svh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  /* Paper texture pattern for cards */
  .paper-texture {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: radial-gradient(var(--color-outline-variant, #d5c2bf) 0.6px, transparent 0.6px);
    background-size: 24px 24px;
    opacity: 0.15;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Container styling - Flex layout to center content vertically and take full viewport */
  .campos-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: var(--spacing-container-max, 1200px);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 96px var(--margin-desktop, 64px);
    box-sizing: border-box;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
    min-height: 100svh;
  }

  .section-header {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .title-divider {
    width: 48px;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: rgba(35, 8, 4, 0.2);
  }

  /* Grid and Cards */
  .cards-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .formativo-card {
    position: relative;
    background-color: var(--color-surface-container-low, #f4f3f1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(35, 8, 4, 0.05);
    border-radius: var(--border-radius-default, 4px);
    padding: 36px 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: var(--transition-smooth);
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .formativo-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(35, 8, 4, 0.06);
    border-color: rgba(35, 8, 4, 0.15);
  }

  .card-icon-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    background-color: var(--color-primary);
    color: var(--color-background);
    border-radius: var(--border-radius-sm, 2px);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .card-icon-wrapper .material-symbols-outlined {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 0, 'wght' 400, 'GRAD' 0, 'opsz' 24;
  }

  .card-heading {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .card-description {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-on-surface-variant, #514441);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Responsive styling */
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .cards-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .campos-container {
      padding: 64px var(--margin-mobile, 20px) 48px;
    }

    .section-header {
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .cards-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .formativo-card {
      padding: 24px;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .card-heading {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .card-description {
      font-size: 13.5px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
  }
</style>
